      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Engineers estimate the park now buffers 13 million cubic metres of stormwater—equal to 5 200 Olympic pools—reducing downstream flash‑flood risk in the Port Lands redevelopment zone.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
